ger is nearby, because <strong>IT</strong> is looking for people among the mannequins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101180/extras/737779de6199e246a347554791aecb85.poster.avif?t=1726520686\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101180/extras/737779de6199e246a347554791aecb85.webm?t=1726520686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101180/extras/737779de6199e246a347554791aecb85.mp4?t=1726520686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Look for notes revealing the secrets of this place. Some mannequins want to help and warn you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101180/extras/2516b09369d52a31305bd3fd4ebc3b97.poster.avif?t=1726520686\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101180/extras/2516b09369d52a31305bd3fd4ebc3b97.webm?t=1726520686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101180/extras/2516b09369d52a31305bd3fd4ebc3b97.mp4?t=1726520686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br>-Unusual gameplay<br>-Realistic and atmospheric graphics<br>-High quality sounds<br>-Multiple endings",
